WEBVTT

00:08:58.162 --> 00:09:01.204
with being an intrinsically motivated
workaholic than with

00:09:01.204 --> 00:09:04.079
a compulsive workaholic, even though
both are highly engaged.

00:09:04.996 --> 00:09:10.037
I agree. You know, I worked
for a while with Gallup.

00:09:10.037 --> 00:09:13.162
I was consulted with Gallup
many years ago.

00:09:14.454 --> 00:09:18.746
And their concept of engagement, I think,
was a positive concept.

00:09:19.537 --> 00:09:24.204
One of the criteria that I remember for
people being happy at work is having

00:09:24.204 --> 00:09:30.954
a friend at work. So clearly, at least,
their concept of engagement,